[# comparison/plan-comparison: pricing plans side by side: each plan's name and price on top, feature rows, and a button under each plan.

   A preset of comparison/comparison-table. Mark one plan as the recommended one with `highlight`. Give every plan a
   button or none of them. Only state real prices and terms.

   Compatibility
   - Outlook desktop: tables, colors and borders honored.
   - Gmail apps: fine. On phones the columns shrink, keep plan names and prices short.
   - Dark mode: cells on the brand surface or background swap via dm-* classes. Header cells keep their colors. #]
[% set cols = [] %]
[% set foot = [] %]
[% for p in data.plans %]
[% set _ = cols.push({ title: p.name, subtitle: (p.price + (' ' + p.period if p.period else '')), highlight: p.highlight }) %]
[% if p.cta %][% set _ = foot.push(p.cta) %][% endif %]
[% endfor %]
[[ c('comparison/comparison-table', { heading: data.heading, intro: data.intro, columns: cols, rows: data.rows, footer: (foot if foot.length else none) }, { variant: s.tableVariant, settings: { hideOnMobile: s.hideOnMobile, hideOnDesktop: s.hideOnDesktop } }) ]]
